    "sharingFinding": "GENUINE, not a check bug: _sharing:domain was auto-materialized on the created rsvp, contradicting the code comment in src/lib/rsvp/rsvpData.ts ('No _sharing: parent (person) is private -> child inherits private by default'). Verified directly: person 6a2fc05e4cd971291c5d5ddc has _sharing:domain (not private/absent), so the auto-inherit rule (entu-api inheritParentProperties, confirmed 2026-08-05 probe-mvox-collective-unshared-prop) materialized domain onto the rsvp child. The code's privacy assumption does not hold for this real person and may not hold for other real singers either -- worth Josquin/team-lead flagging before #10 build, since a domain-shared rsvp is readable by any domain-authenticated user, not private as the comment implies."
